No package:collection import in agent_loop.dart. `lastOrNull` is provided by `package:collection`'s `IterableExtension`. Dart 3.0+ doesn't have it in dart:core. To avoid adding an import, replace with a manual check:

```dart
if (messages.isEmpty || messages.last is! AssistantMessage) return null;
final messageIndex = messages.length - 1;
```

